  <History Date="20-05-26" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (confusing charts.  56 channel mode contains a 16bit iris on channels 32 and 33 and another iris on 55.  this doesn't make sense.  assumed 55 is LSB of 16bit blade rotation)" Version="0" />
